&lt;h2&gt;


References
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.codeant.ai/security-research/pac4j-jwt-authentication-bypass-public-key" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Full Technical Research — CodeAnt AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
