&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.pac4j.org/blog/security-advisory-pac4j-jwt-jwtauthenticator.html" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;pac4j Security Advisory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
